                "headline": "Coastal Flood Advisory issued September 25 at 5:27AM EDT until September 27 at 6:00PM EDT by NWS Upton NY",
                "description": "* WHAT...One to two feet of inundation above ground level\nexpected in vulnerable areas near the waterfront and shoreline.\n\n* WHERE...Hudson, Eastern Essex and Eastern Union Counties.\n\n* WHEN...From 6 PM this evening to 6 PM EDT Sunday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Minor to locally flooding in the more vulnerable\nlocations near the waterfront and shoreline. Some roads and low\nlying properties including parking lots, parks, lawns, and homes\nand businesses with basements near the waterfront will\nexperience minor flooding.",
